ATTRIBUTION NOTE, AND ONE REQUEST THAT IS NOT A LICENCE TERM

Suggested attribution:

  "Project Volt (2026), https://github.com/valimenai-ux/project-volt,
   CC BY 4.0."

The request, which this licence does not and cannot enforce: if you quote a
number from this repository, carry its status with it. Every verdict here is
frozen at the status BASELINE_v7_FREEZE.md gives it, several are provisional,
and none has been validated against hardware — the Vehicle Zero reference model
is uncalibrated against its own sourced anchor. LIMITATIONS.md says exactly what
is and is not established. A number from this repository quoted without its
status is a misquotation of the record even though it is a correct copy of the
digits.

